PATCH   http://localhost:3874/users/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 
{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password":""
}
### Remove a User (same user auth)
DELETE  http://localhost:3874/users/remove
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 

{
    "password":""
}
